A successful update emits a unified diff on stdout with ---, +++, and @@ header lines.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
status: backlog
---
# Plan body

-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Test Plan
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
 ---
 # Plan body
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
status: in-progress
---
# Plan body

